      <details class="skin-faq-item">
        <summary>How long does red light therapy take to work for skin in UAE?</summary>
        <div class="skin-faq-answer">
          <p>Most people notice improvements in overall skin tone and brightness within 2 to 4 weeks of regular use. More visible wrinkle reduction and collagen-related improvements usually become clearer after 6 to 8 weeks. Results are cumulative, so consistency matters most.</p>
